<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Combat Extended</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <success>Always</success>
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/CombatExtended.AmmoCategoryDef[defName="WA_ArtillerySignal"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>포격 신호</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/CombatExtended.AmmoCategoryDef[defName="WA_ArtillerySignal"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>울페인 궤도 포격의 목표 지점을 표시하는 신호탄입니다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/CombatExtended.AmmoCategoryDef[defName="WA_RescueSignal"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>구조 신호</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/CombatExtended.AmmoCategoryDef[defName="WA_RescueSignal"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>표시된 구역으로 저항군 증원을 호출하는 신호탄입니다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_Flare"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>조명탄 x5 제작</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_Flare"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>조명탄 5개를 제작합니다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_Flare"]/jobString</xpath>
          <value>
            <jobString>조명탄 제작 중.</jobString>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_ArtillerySignal"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>포격 신호탄 x1 제작</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_ArtillerySignal"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>CE 탄약 주입을 위한 임시 제작법입니다. 포격 신호탄은 보상으로만 획득할 수 있습니다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_ArtillerySignal"]/jobString</xpath>
          <value>
            <jobString>포격 신호탄 제작 중.</jobString>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_RescueSignal"]/label</xpath>
          <value>
            <label>구조 신호탄 1개 제작</label>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_RescueSignal"]/description</xpath>
          <value>
            <description>CE 탄약 주입을 위한 임시 제작법입니다. 구조 신호탄은 보상으로만 획득할 수 있습니다.</description>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>/Defs/RecipeDef[defName="MakeWA_Shell_RescueSignal"]/jobString</xpath>
          <value>
            <jobString>구조 신호탄 제작 중.</jobString>
          </value>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <success>Always</success>
    <xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Wolfein_Faction_MegaCorp"]/royalFavorLabel</xpath>
    <value>
      <royalFavorLabel>기업 공로</royalFavorLabel>
    </value>
  </Operation>
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <success>Always</success>
    <xpath>/Defs/FactionDef[defName="Wolfein_Faction_Rebel"]/royalFavorLabel</xpath>
    <value>
      <royalFavorLabel>저항군 명예</royalFavorLabel>
    </value>
  </Operation>
</Patch>